  "services": "Helium services\n\nLune uses services hosted by Helium for extension downloads, !bangs, filter lists, dictionaries, and component updates.\n\nAllow connecting to Helium services\n\nAllow Lune to connect to Helium-hosted services. These requests stay disabled until you consent.\n\nAllow automatic Helium services updates\n\nAutomatically download and install updates to Lune-provided browser components.\n\nProxy extension downloads and updates\n\nWhen enabled, Lune will proxy extension downloads and updates to protect your privacy. When disabled, downloading and updating extensions will not work.\n\nAllow downloading the !bangs list\n\nLune will fetch a list of bangs that help you browse the Internet faster, such as !w or !gh. When disabled, bangs will not work.\n\nAllow downloading filter lists for uBlock Origin\n\nLune will fetch fresh filter lists for uBlock Origin. All requests to lists are proxied to protect your privacy. When disabled, default filter lists will be loaded from local storage, which are only updated along with Lune. Optional filter lists will be requested without proxying.\n\nUse your own instance of Helium services\n\nYou can host your own Helium services instance and select it in Lune settings.",
